      "title": "Gas book \u2014 what was bought, when, and at what price",
      "description": "Every purchase against the portfolio, newest first. `landed` is false for a forward: a trade struck today for a future window sits on the book from the moment it is struck and only enters the pool at its window start. That is the point of keeping trades separate from the fuel ledger \u2014 and it is what lets you buy something now and find out later whether it was a good trade. price is EUR/MWh THERMAL paid, directly comparable with the TTF mark below; that difference is the fuel P&L.",
