    {
      "type": "volkovlabs-form-panel",
      "title": "Buy gas",
      "description": "Buys gas for the portfolio as a row on the gas book, through the tickerplant like any other tick. A fresh stack has an EMPTY POOL because nothing buys gas on its own, so nothing can be offered until gas is bought here. Term: give a price and a delivery window; the volume lands in the pool at the window start, so a future window shows as `forward` until then. Spot: buys at the current TTF mark, landing now, and ignores price/from/to. `to` is EXCLUSIVE. There is no ceiling to overfill \u2014 that was the tank, and a CCGT does not have one.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "grafana"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
